{
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "Ascendancy charm definitions. Charms are temporary single-stat buffs that drop from solo monsters (Orc, Skeleton, Golem only). 8 stat categories × 3 grades = 24 charm types. Players activate charms manually; one charm per stat category can be active simultaneously, but multiple categories stack.",
